    (1509::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'This seated host bar is easiest around its 20:00 opening; later arrivals may trade a short wait for a poorer show view. Two nightly shows are advertised. Ask about drink, host-drink and any companionship fees before ordering, and settle each round visibly.',
      'best_nights', 'The show format runs nightly, so choose the evening that fits your trip rather than chasing Saturday alone. Arrive before the first set for seats and stay for the second if the cast clicks. Current reviews are mixed, making the live programme more useful than reputation.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Gay male tourists and expats are prominent, with local Thai patrons and male hosts completing the room. The audience spans ages, while the staff presentation skews young and performance-led. This is commercial host-bar cabaret, not an organic neighborhood mixer.',
      'dress_code', 'Neat casual clothes are sufficient: clean shirt, shorts or trousers and comfortable shoes. No formal fashion policy is published. Bring enough for your own evening, decide your spending limit in advance and keep a calm, clear boundary around invitations.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Some guests praise the entertainment and welcome; others report weak shows, tired facilities, dirty restrooms or poor management. The venue is explicitly gay, but service confidence is uneven. Confirm every price and treat pressure or disrespect as a reason to leave.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_long_running_chiang_mai_gay_male_host_bar_formerly_circle_pub_with_two_nightly_seated_shows_tourist_expat_local_audience_and_mixed_entertainment_cleanliness_management_review_consensus',
      'identity_note', 'New Circle Club Chiangmai is the renamed Circle Pub, a gay male host and show bar at Soi Erawan. It should not be described as a general dance club.',
