    (1510::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'There is rarely a real line; the small open bar simply runs out of comfortable seats. Arrive around sunset for the Night Bazaar view, or accept a livelier squeeze later. Confirm host-drink prices before buying a round and carry cash for a clean closeout.',
      'best_nights', 'Friday and Saturday are busiest, but a relaxed weekday can be better for pool, conversation and people-watching. Recent regulars enjoy the 18:00–22:00 stretch; after that the mood depends on who remains. This is a social stop, not a destination dance club.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Gay travellers, expats, local regulars and predominantly young Myanmar hosts share the little bar, with straight friends also welcome. Ages skew broader among customers than staff. The commercial host element is visible but does not define every conversation.',
      'dress_code', 'Night-market casual works: shorts, tee, sandals or trainers and something rainproof in wet season. No dress gate is reported. Smoke and open-air heat can shape comfort, so choose washable layers and keep valuables close while moving through the bazaar.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Many recent guests call the owner and team exceptionally warm, affordable and easy company; repeat visitors feel remembered. Counter-reports mention drink pressure, smoke and restroom cleanliness. Say no clearly, price host drinks first and choose a seat that feels comfortable.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_small_open_air_gay_host_bar_in_chiang_mai_night_bazaar_with_pool_people_watching_affordable_drinks_gay_traveller_expat_local_and_myanmar_host_mix_warm_recent_consensus_with_smoke_pressure_cleanliness_caveats',
      'identity_note', 'Orion Bar is a small Night Bazaar gay bar with hosts, pool and outdoor seating. It is active, but not a polished nightclub and not uniformly reviewed.',
