    (503::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'Early evening is an easy walk-in; late Friday and Saturday can produce a compact ID line as country dancing gives way to a busier floor. Bring physical government ID. Check the event post for cover, lessons and special-party entry before joining the queue.',
      'best_nights', 'Thursday country dancing and weekend late nights show the bar’s range; drag and themed parties add another rhythm. Come earlier to learn line dances and talk, later for a packed floor. Choose the posted event rather than assuming every night is cowboy night.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Gay men form the core, joined by lesbians, trans and nonbinary guests, allies, country-dance regulars and late-night partygoers. Ages broaden during lessons and narrow later. The room is more community bar than tourist attraction, even in busy Northalsted.',
      'dress_code', 'Boots and denim feel at home but are never required; tees, tanks, trainers and themed looks work too. Wear shoes you can actually dance in and layers for a warm floor. Physical ID matters more than costume, and event flyers may suggest a playful theme.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Regulars praise the unpretentious queer welcome, dancing and bartenders, while some reviews flag door or service inconsistency when crowded. The long-running gay identity is clear. Ask about cover and drink prices up front, and seek a manager if a boundary is mishandled.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_long_running_northalsted_gay_country_and_dance_bar_with_line_dancing_drag_theme_nights_late_weekend_floor_broad_queer_ally_crowd_and_friendly_unpretentious_consensus_with_busy_door_service_variability',
      'identity_note', 'Charlie’s Chicago is an active gay country-and-dance bar in Northalsted, not merely a generic nightclub. Its programme extends beyond country music on many nights.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.charlieschicago.com/','https://www.instagram.com/charlieschicago/','https://www.restaurantji.com/il/chicago/charlies-chicago-/','https://chicago.gaycities.com/bars/168-charlies-chicago','https://www.reddit.com/r/chicagogaybros/comments/1svp5eb/gay_bars_alone_as_a_visitor/']::text[]),
